flowchart TD
 ASK["local/remote MCP request_decision"] --> CHECK["Decisions.requireCheck"]
 CHECK -->|confirm_required: まだ未受付| LIST["要約一覧 + check_token → AI"]
 LIST -->|同一申請再提出| CREATE["create: useCheck / rate / duplicate / recommendation"]
 CREATE -->|invalid/duplicate/rate| ERROR["ApiError → JSON/MCP isError"]
 CREATE --> TX["tx: decision + bindRequest + history + event row"]
 TX -->|rollback: event副作用なし| ERROR
 TX -->|commit| PENDING["pending v1: 受付完了"]
 PENDING --> HOLD["setHold → held"]
 HOLD --> PENDING
 PENDING --> AMEND["amend: version check / 全画像置換 / history"]
 HOLD --> AMEND
 AMEND --> PRESERVE["更新前のpending/heldを維持"]
 PENDING --> CANCEL["cancel → cancelled: 画像保持 / 未結合draft削除"]
 HOLD --> CANCEL
 PENDING --> ANSWER["answer: version/options/attachments検証"]
 HOLD --> ANSWER
 ANSWER -->|409: 最新Decisionを返す| ERROR
 ANSWER --> ATX["tx: bindAttachments + answer + history + delivery waiting"]
 ATX --> ANSWERED["answered: 回答保存済み"]
 ANSWERED --> DELIVERY["配送は独立状態: waiting/sending/delivered/failed/unknown/fetched"]
 CANCEL --> DELETE["deleteClosed: tx / purgeExpired: 1行ずつ削除"]
 ANSWERED --> DELETE
 DELETE --> GC["添付等のDB cascade → decision.deleted → files GC"]
 ACCOUNT["DELETE me: 全status / 診断寄与 / 原本削除"] --> ACCOUNT_TX["外側tx: user cascade + eraseFiles / FS失敗でDB rollback"]
